   - R²: ${lastTournamentResult.langmuir.r2.toFixed(4)} | RMSE: ${lastTournamentResult.langmuir.rmse.toFixed(3)} | Chi-Sq: ${lastTournamentResult.langmuir.chiSquare.toFixed(3)}

2. FREUNDLICH ISOTHERM:
   - KF: ${pF.kF?.value.toFixed(2)}
